  <strong>[[direwolf]]</strong><br><br>
A dire wolf (or direwolf) refers to a prehistoric, extinct canine that roamed the Americas during the Pleistocene epoch. In popular culture, the term is frequently used in fantasy and role-playing games to describe a fictional, massively oversized, and vicious wolf.

